; Footbridge (issue #315): a rope bridge of three CrumblingLedges (#18) over
; a 580 px chasm between two wide banks, with a MovingPlatform (#279) shuttling
; overhead as the way round once the bridge is gone, and a short row of Spikes
; (#282) on each bank's inner lip. Ledges drop 0.8 s after first contact and
; return after 3 s, so the bridge is a timing game, not a toll. All eight
; spawns are on the banks, clear of the spikes.
